sfer in the operating ensemble. That is a missing chemical interface, rather than a limitation cured merely by obtaining access to a microscope.I retain this as the stronger scientific opening at the present boundary. Its favourable completion would add an addressed post-assembly operation on an otherwise hidden material variable. The collector’s favourable escape saddle would presently establish survival of a much more limited concentration operation. The exact permutation construction, the read-and-restore theory, the exposure costs and the chemical counterexample remain useful independently of whether silicon ultimately proves to be the best mediator.
